hadiths[24]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3248","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay qsm khayy thy kh wh ayk mah tk apny bywywn say dwr rhyn gay۔ as ka paon mnqta hwnay ky wjh say wh antys ratyn awpr kay kmray myn rha awr phr nychay aaya۔ awr jb an say yh kha gya kh aap nay ayk mhynh dwr rhnay ky qsm khayy hay tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh mhynh antys dn ka hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3249","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh abwbkr rzy allh anh aayay awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas janay ky ajazt chahy، lykn lwgwn kw aap kay drwazay pr bythay hwyay paya، an myn say ksy kw bhy ajazt nhyn dy gyy۔ albth abwbkr kw ajazt ml gyy awr wh andr dakhl hwyay۔ as kay bad amr rzy allh anh aagay aayay awr jb anhwn nay pwchha awr ajazt day dy gyy tw dykha kh nby krym sly allh alyh wslm apny bywywn kay sath ghmgyn awr khamwsh bythay hyn۔ as nay byan kya kh myn nay kwyy aysy bat khnay ka fyslh kya js say rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw hnsy aajayay، tw aap nay frmaya: \khda kay rswl، kash aap nay kharjh ky byty kw dykha hwta jb as nay mjh say azafy rqm mangy tw myn nay ath kr as ky grdn pr thpr mara۔\"" rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hnstay hwyay frmaya: \""wh myray ardgrd mwjwd hyn jb tm azafy rqm mang rhay hw۔\"" phr abwbkr rzy allh anh athay، aayshh rzy allh anha kay pas gyay awr an ky grdn pr thpr mara، awr amr rzy allh anh nay hfsh rzy allh anha kay sath bhy aysa hy kya، dwnwn nay kha: kya tm rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say wh chyz mang rhay hw jw aap kay pas nhyn hay؟ sb nay jwab dya kh hm khda ky qsm kha kr khtay hyn kh hm rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say wh chyz nhyn mangyn gay jw aap kay pas nhyn hay۔ as kay bad wh ayk mah ya antys dn kay lyay an say alg hw gyay۔ as kay bad yh aayt nazl hwyy، ’’aay nby! apny bywywn say khh dw kh tm myn say nyky krnay walwn kay lyay bra ajr hay‘‘ (alqraan 33:28 ayf)۔ as kay bad wh sb say phlay aayshh kay pas gyay awr kha kh myn aap kw ayk bat btana chahta hwn، lykn apnay waldyn say mshwrh krnay say phlay jld bazy myn jwab nhyn dyna chahta۔ jb as nay as say pwchha kh yh kya hay awr as nay asay aayt prh kr snayy tw as nay kha: kya myn aap kay baray myn apnay waldyn say mshwrh krwn، blkh myn nay khda، as kay rswl awr aakhry thkanay ka antkhab kya hay، lykn myn aap say khty hwn kh aap apny bywywn myn say ksy kw yh nh btayyn kh myn nay kya kha hay۔ as nay jwab dya، \""an myn say kwyy bhy mjh say myray btayay bghyr nhyn pwchhay ga، allh nay mjhay skhty krnay ya nqsan phnchanay kay lyay nhyn bhyja، blkh mjhay skhanay awr aasan krnay kay lyay bhyja hay۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3250","aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha: myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt myn hazr hwnay waly awrtwn say hsd krtay hwyay pwchha: kya awrt apnay aap kw pysh krty hay؟ phr jb allh taalyٰ nay nazl frmaya، ’’tm an myn say js kw chahw mwkhr kr sktay hw awr jsay chahw apnay pas lay lw، awr agr tm ksy kw chahw tw tm pr kwyy gnah nhyn‘‘ (alqraan 33:51) kha، ’’mjhay lgta hay kh tmhara rb tmhary khwahsh pwry krnay myn jldy kr rha hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3251","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh jb wh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath sfr myn thyn tw anhwn nay aap sly allh alyh wslm kw pydl dwraya awr aap kw mara، lykn jb wh bry hwyy tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn mara۔ as nay kha، \yh as mar ky tlafy krta hay۔\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"3252","anhwn nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm myn say bhtr wh hay jw apnay ghr walwn kay lyay bhtr hw awr myn tm myn say apnay ghr walwn kay lyay sb say bhtr hwn، jb tm myn say kwyy mr jayay tw asay bra nh khw۔ asay trmzy awr darmy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3253","abn majh nay asay abn abas rzy allh anh say \myray ghr walwn tk\"" tk phnchaya۔"""""
"3254","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb awrt panch wqt ky nmaz prhay، rmzan kay rwzay rkhay، apny aft ky hfazt kray awr apnay shwhr ky ataat kray، tw wh jnt kay js drwazay say chahay dakhl hw skty hay۔ abw naym nay asay hlyh myn nql kya hay۔"
"3255","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr myn ksy kw hkm dyta kh wh dwsray kw sjdh kray tw myn awrt kw hkm dyta kh wh apnay shwhr kw sjdh kray۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3256","am slmh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw awrt as hal myn mr jayay kh as ka shwhr as say razy hw tw wh jnt myn jayay gy۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3257","talq b۔ aly rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb kwyy shkhs apny bywy kw apny khwahsh pwry krnay kay lyay blayay tw asay as kay pas jana chahyay، chahay wh tnwr myn hy kywn nh hw“۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3258","maaz rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh dnya myn kwyy bhy awrt apnay shwhr kw tng nhyn krty jb tk kh as ky bywy bry aankhwn waly knwarywn myn say yh khty hw kh tm asay tng nh krw، khda tm pr lant kray، wh tmharay sath srf gzrnay wala mhman hay awr tmhyn hmaray pas chhwrnay wala hay۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"3259","hkym by۔ maawyh alqshyry nay apnay wald kay hwalay say byan kya hay kh anhwn nay pwchha: \khda kay rswl، kwyy bywy apnay shwhr say kya hq mang skty hay؟\"" aap nay jwab dya: \""jb tm khao tw asay khana dw، jb phnw tw asay phnao، as kay mnh pr nh marw، awr asay bra nh khw awr nh hy ghr kay alawh as say alyhdgy akhtyar krw۔\"" yh"""""
"3260","lkyt by۔ sabrh nay btaya kh as nay kha، \khda kay rswl، myry ayk bywy hay js ky zban myn kchh hay،\"" yany gndy tqryr۔ as nay as say kha kh asay tlaq day day lykn jb as nay jwab dya kh as say myra byta hay awr wh sathy hay tw as nay kha asay hkm dw (yany asay nsyht krw) awr agr as myn kwyy bhlayy hay tw wh asay qbwl kr lay gy lykn apny bywy kw as trh nh marw js trh tm apny jwan lwndy kw marty hw۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"3261","ayas by۔ abdallh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh ky lwndywn kw mt marw۔ lykn jb amr rzy allh anh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay awr kha kh awrtyn apnay shwhrwn ky trf mtwjh hw gyy hyn tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn marnay ky ajazt day dy۔ phr bht sy awrtyn apnay shwhrwn ky shkayt krtay hwyay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay ghr walwn kay grd ghwmty hyn، awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \bht sy awrtyn apnay shwhrwn ky shkayt krtay hwyay mhmd sly allh alyh wslm kay khandan kay grd ghwmty hyn، wh tm myn say bhtryn nhyn hyn۔\"" abwdaod، abn majh awr darmy nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"3262","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay bywy kw as kay shwhr ya ghlam say as kay aaqa kay lyay naraz kya wh hm myn say nhyn hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3263","aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mwmnwn myn sb say zyadh kaml ayman walay wh hyn jw sb say achhay akhlaq walay awr apnay ghr walwn kay sath hsn slwk krnay walay hyn۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3264","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ayman myn sb say zyadh kaml ayman walay wh hyn jw sb say achhay akhlaq walay hyn awr tm myn say bhtryn wh hyn jw apny bywywn kay sath achhay hyn۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn shyh hay awr abwdaod nay asay \msybt\"" tk nql kya hay۔"""""
"3265","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ghzwh tbwk ya hnyn kay lyay tshryf layay tw hwa nay ayk prday kay sray kw athaya jw an kay gwdam kay samnay rkha hwa tha، js say an ky kchh grya zahr hwyyn۔ as nay as say pwchha kh yh kya hay tw as nay jwab dya kh yh as ky grya hyn۔ an kay drmyan as nay ayk ghwra dykha js kay prwn pr chythray bnay hwyay thay awr pwchha kh as nay an myn kya dykha؟ as nay asay btaya kh yh ayk ghwra hay، awr jb as nay pwchha kh as myn kya chyz hay awr as nay jwab dya kh as kay pr hyn، tw as nay kha: prwn wala ghwra! as nay jwab dya kya tm nay nhyn sna kh slyman kay prwn walay ghwray thay؟ as nay kha kh wh atnay dl say hnsa kh wh as kay pchhlay dant dykh skty thy۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3266","qys b۔ sad rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn hyrh kay pas gya awr dykha kh wh an kay ayk dstar kay samnay sjdh kr rhay hyn tw myn nay kha: allh kay rswl sly allh alyh wslm kw sjdh krnay ka sb say zyadh hq hay۔ jb myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt myn hazr hwa tw myn nay kha kh myn alhyrh gya awr dykha kh wh apnay ayk srdar kw sjdh kr rhay hyn lykn aap kw sb say zyadh hq hasl hay kh lwg aap kw sjdh kryn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”btao، agr tm myry qbr kay pas say gzrw tw kya tm as kay aagay sjdh krw gay؟ phr jb myn nay kha kh myn aysa nhyn krwn ga tw as nay jwab dya kh tm myn say kwyy bhy aysa nh kray، agr myn ksy kw ksy dwsray kay samnay sjdh krnay ka hkm dyta tw myn awrtwn kw hkm dyta kh wh apnay shwhrwn kw sjdh kryn، kywnkh an pr khda ka khas hq hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3267","ahmd nay asay maaz bn ky snd say nql kya hay۔ jbl۔"
"3268","hzrt amr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mrd say yh nh pwchha jayay kh wh apny bywy kw kywn marta hay۔ abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3269","abwsayd rzy allh anh nay ayk awrt ka byan kya jw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayy awr kha kh myra shwhr sfwan bn almtla jb myn nmaz prhta hwn tw mjhay marta hay، jb myn aftar krta hwn tw mjhay aftar krwata hay awr jb tk swrj tlwa nhyn hw jata fjr ky nmaz nhyn prhta۔ sfwan whan mwjwd tha tw as nay as say pwchha kh as nay kya kha hay tw as nay jwab dya: ya rswl allh، as kay as qwl kay baray myn kh myn asay marta hwn jb wh nmaz prhty hay، wh dw swrtyn prhty hay awr myn nay asay as say mna kya hay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: agr yh ayk swrt hwty tw lwgwn kay lyay kafy hwty۔ as nay jary rkha: \jhan tk as ka yh byan hay kh myn asay rwzh aftar krwata hwn jb wh rwzh rkhty hay، tw wh rwzh rkhty hay، awr myn ayk nwjwan hwn jw apnay aap pr qabw nhyn rkh skta۔\"" rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ’’awrt srf apnay shwhr ky ajazt say rwzh rkh skty hay۔‘‘ aap nay mzyd frmaya: ’’jhan tk as ka yh qwl hay kh myn swrj tlwa hwnay tk nmaz nhyn prhta، myn as khandan say talq rkhta hwn jw atny shhrt rkhta hay، swrj tlwa hwnay tk mshkl say bydar hwta hwn۔‘‘ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”phr jb tm bydar hw، sfwan، tm nmaz prhw۔ * as say mrad wh rwzay hyn jw frz nhyn hyn۔ abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"3270","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh ayk dfah rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm mhajryn awr mddgarwn kay sath thay، ayk awnt aaya awr aap sly allh alyh wslm kw sjdh kya۔ tw as kay sathywn nay arz kya kh aay khda kay rswl، janwr awr drkht aap kay samnay sjdh krtay hyn lykn hm aysa krnay ka sb say zyadh hqdar hyn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: apnay rb ky abadt krw awr apnay bhayy ky azt krw، agr myn ksy kw dwsray kw sjdh krnay ka hkm dyta tw awrt kw hkm dyta kh wh apnay shwhr kw sjdh kray، awr agr wh asay hkm dyta kh wh pthr kw zrd phar say syah ya syah phar say sfyd tk phncha day tw yh as pr wajb hay۔ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3271","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tyn aysay hyn jn ky daa qbwl nhyn hwty awr jn kay nyk aamal aasman pr nhyn athayay jatay: ayk bhaga hwa ghlam، yhan tk kh wh apnay srprstwn kay pas waps aajayay awr an kay hath myn hath dalay، ayk awrt js say as ka shwhr naraz hw، awr ayk shraby، yhan tk kh wh hwshyar hw jayay۔ byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔"
